title: "Analysis code for: Intrinsic capacity grades risk and recovery within frailty phenotype categories (KFACS)"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for a five-wave analysis of intrinsic capacity and
  bidirectional transitions among disability states, frailty states and death in
  the Korean Frailty and Aging Cohort Study (n = 3,011).
